/* NOTE: Message Digest functions are set based on availability and by the
 * following order of preference.
 * 1. libc
 * 2. libc2
 * 3. libc3
 * 4. libSystem
 * 5. Nettle
 * 6. OpenSSL
 * 7. libmd
 * 8. Windows API
